OL,3,GNEWSAOxford Street to be pedestrianised
OL,4,Afrom October
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of Oxford Street will be
OL,7,Fpedestrianised from 26 October, London
OL,8,FMayor Sadiq Khan has announced.
OL,10,FBuses, taxis, bikes and other vehicles,
OL,11,Fwill be banned from the stretch of the
OL,12,Froad spanning almost a kilometre from
OL,13,FOrchard Street to Great Portland
OL,14,FStreet.
OL,16,FLord Khan said: "Following strong
OL,17,Fsupport from Londoners and businesses,
OL,18,FI'm excited to see my bold vision for
OL,19,FOxford Street really coming to life
OL,20,Fnext month as we start going
OL,21,Ftraffic-free, just in time for the busy
OL,22,FChristmas shopping period."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
